  "id": "parasitism",
  "term": "parasitism",
  "definition": "Parasitism here means the rate or extent to which female Trichogramma ostriniae lay their eggs on host egg cards under different conditions. In this study, it refers to how often the wasps used available eggs for oviposition, which varied with factors such as card color and inoculation time.",
